Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Permissions|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: View Blogs Entry Reg Role Inline
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPRolesCPBlogs#ViewBlogsEntryRegRoleInline|
	And Permissions set Up Reg Role Login User CP
		|portletName|Blogs|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Permissions define Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_BLOGS_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ACCESS_IN_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Access in Site Administration|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And PermissionsInline goto Blogs Entry CP
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Role remove Permission PG
		|permissionDefinitionKey|CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_VIEW_CHECKBOX|
		|roleTitle|Guest|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And BlogsEntry view Default CP
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And PermissionsInline goto Blogs Entry CP
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Role define Permission PG
		|permissionDefinitionKey|CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_VIEW_CHECKBOX|
		|roleTitle|Guest|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And Portlet change Display Style
		|displayStyle|List|
	And BlogsEntry view Entry Table
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntry view Entry Author CP
		|entryAuthorFullName|Test Test|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And these variables
		|key_entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And AssertClick the value 'Blogs Entry Title' at locator 'Blogs#ENTRY_TABLE_TITLE'
	Then BlogsEntry view Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
